{"id":"198e3b21cd4c6cd2","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff.md","title":"omega 集合的反射嵌入","display":"thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff — omega 集合的反射嵌入","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff","aliases":["16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff","16-omega-sets-embedding-eff"],"display":"thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff — omega 集合的反射嵌入","depends_on":["[[16-df-assembly]]","[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]"],"source":"Proposition 6.2.3, pp. 386–387 (PDF 406–407)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff</span><span>16-omega-sets-embedding-eff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff — omega 集合的反射嵌入"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c2ab0a38c74fb9f\" href=\"?note=1c2ab0a38c74fb9f\" title=\"16-df-assembly\">16-df-assembly</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ffba7376827cc25\" href=\"?note=8ffba7376827cc25\" title=\"16-df-effective-global-sections\">16-df-effective-global-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 6.2.3, pp. 386–387 (PDF 406–407)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\">\\(\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Eff}\">\\(\\mathbf{Eff}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1c2ab0a38c74fb9f\" href=\"?note=1c2ab0a38c74fb9f\" title=\"16-df-assembly\">16-df-assembly</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ffba7376827cc25\" href=\"?note=8ffba7376827cc25\" title=\"16-df-effective-global-sections\">16-df-effective-global-sections</a> 的范畴与全局截面构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(I,\\rho)\">\\(A=(I,\\rho)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=(J,\\sigma)\">\\(B=(J,\\sigma)\\)</span> 为Eff对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\langle A,B,[R]\\rangle:A\\to B\">\\(H=\\langle A,B,[R]\\rangle:A\\to B\\)</span> 为Eff的带标签箭头。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,E),(Y,G)\">\\((X,E),(Y,G)\\)</span> 为assembly，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:(X,E)\\to(Y,G)\">\\(f:(X,E)\\to(Y,G)\\)</span> 为可实现函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,s,\\rho_E,R_f,\\widetilde E_A\">\\(F,s,\\rho_E,R_f,\\widetilde E_A\\)</span> 在下节构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[R_f]\">\\([R_f]\\)</span> 表示功能关系的逻辑等价类。完整assembly箭头为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle(X,E),(Y,G),f\\rangle\">\\(\\langle(X,E),(Y,G),f\\rangle\\)</span>；固定Hom中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ff\">\\(Ff\\)</span> 简写该完整箭头的像。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma[R]\">\\(\\Gamma[R]\\)</span> 是全局截面原子在固定源靶上的裸函数图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[i]\">\\([i]\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(i,i)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\rho(i,i)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 时使用，并取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma A\">\\(\\Gamma A\\)</span> 的支持等价类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dashv\">\\(\\dashv\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>；下文 Hom 映射作用于带源靶标签的完整箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span> 是与 Eff 共同基底的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_E(x,x^{\\prime})&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}E(x)&amp;x=x^{\\prime},\\\\\\varnothing&amp;x\\ne x^{\\prime},\\end{cases}\n&amp;F_0(X,E)&amp;\\coloneqq(X,\\rho_E),\\\\\nR_f(x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}E(x)&amp;f(x)=y,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;f(x)\\ne y,\\end{cases}\n&amp;F_1\\langle(X,E),(Y,G),f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F_0(X,E),F_0(Y,G),[R_f]\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widetilde E_A(c)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in c}\\rho(i,i)\\quad(c\\in\\Gamma A),\n&amp;s_0(A)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma A,\\widetilde E_A),\\\\\ns_1\\langle A,B,[R]\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle s_0(A),s_0(B),\\Gamma[R]\\rangle,\\\\\nF&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle,&amp;s&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle s_0,s_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_E(x,x^{\\prime})&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}E(x)&amp;x=x^{\\prime},\\\\\\varnothing&amp;x\\ne x^{\\prime},\\end{cases}\n&amp;F_0(X,E)&amp;\\coloneqq(X,\\rho_E),\\\\\nR_f(x,y)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}E(x)&amp;f(x)=y,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;f(x)\\ne y,\\end{cases}\n&amp;F_1\\langle(X,E),(Y,G),f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F_0(X,E),F_0(Y,G),[R_f]\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widetilde E_A(c)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in c}\\rho(i,i)\\quad(c\\in\\Gamma A),\n&amp;s_0(A)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Gamma A,\\widetilde E_A),\\\\\ns_1\\langle A,B,[R]\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle s_0(A),s_0(B),\\Gamma[R]\\rangle,\\\\\nF&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle,&amp;s&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle s_0,s_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Functor}(F,\\omega\\mathbf{Sets},\\mathbf{Eff}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Functor}(s,\\mathbf{Eff},\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}),\\qquad s\\dashv F,\\\\\nF_{(X,E),(Y,G)}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,F_1(a)\\rangle\\mid a\\in\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}((X,E),(Y,G))\\},\\\\\nF_{(X,E),(Y,G)}:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}((X,E),(Y,G))\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(F_0(X,E),F_0(Y,G)).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Functor}(F,\\omega\\mathbf{Sets},\\mathbf{Eff}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Functor}(s,\\mathbf{Eff},\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}),\\qquad s\\dashv F,\\\\\nF_{(X,E),(Y,G)}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,F_1(a)\\rangle\\mid a\\in\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}((X,E),(Y,G))\\},\\\\\nF_{(X,E),(Y,G)}:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}((X,E),(Y,G))\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(F_0(X,E),F_0(Y,G)).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>证明：可实现函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:s(I,\\rho)\\to(X,E)\">\\(h:s(I,\\rho)\\to(X,E)\\)</span> 对应关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H(i,x)=\\rho(i,i)\">\\(H(i,x)=\\rho(i,i)\\)</span> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h([i])=x\">\\(h([i])=x\\)</span>，否则为空。函数的统一代码实现关系的严格性和单值性；反向关系箭头产生唯一底层函数，利用全定义与严格性的统一代码得到其 tracker。</li>\n<li>两构造给出自然 Hom 双射，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"sF(X,E)\\cong(X,E)\">\\(sF(X,E)\\cong(X,E)\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 满忠实。</li>\n<li>原文件把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 错写成“去掉无实现元元素”，遗漏等价商与实现集合的并；伴随方向应为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\dashv F\">\\(s\\dashv F\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Proposition 6.2.3, pp. 386–387 (PDF 406–407)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-assembly","status":"resolved","id":"1c2ab0a38c74fb9f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-assembly]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-effective-global-sections","status":"resolved","id":"8ffba7376827cc25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-assembly","status":"resolved","id":"1c2ab0a38c74fb9f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}$、$\\mathbf{Eff}$ 及 $\\Gamma$ 采用 [[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]] 的范畴与全局截面构造。$A=(I,\\rho)$、$B=(J,\\sigma)$ 为Eff对象；$H=\\langle A,B,[R]\\rangle:A\\to B$ 为Eff的带标签箭头。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-effective-global-sections","status":"resolved","id":"8ffba7376827cc25","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}$、$\\mathbf{Eff}$ 及 $\\Gamma$ 采用 [[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]] 的范畴与全局截面构造。$A=(I,\\rho)$、$B=(J,\\sigma)$ 为Eff对象；$H=\\langle A,B,[R]\\rangle:A\\to B$ 为Eff的带标签箭头。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 与 $\\dashv$ 分别采用 [[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]；下文 Hom 映射作用于带源靶标签的完整箭头。$\\mathbf{Set}$ 是与 Eff 共同基底的 $\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 与 $\\dashv$ 分别采用 [[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]；下文 Hom 映射作用于带源靶标签的完整箭头。$\\mathbf{Set}$ 是与 Eff 共同基底的 $\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Eff}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"A=(I,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"B=(J,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"H=\\langle A,B,[R]\\rangle:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"(X,E),(Y,G)","display":false},{"tex":"f:(X,E)\\to(Y,G)","display":false},{"tex":"F,s,\\rho_E,R_f,\\widetilde E_A","display":false},{"tex":"[R_f]","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle(X,E),(Y,G),f\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"Ff","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma[R]","display":false},{"tex":"[i]","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho(i,i)\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\dashv","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\rho_E(x,x^{\\prime})&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}E(x)&x=x^{\\prime},\\\\\\varnothing&x\\ne x^{\\prime},\\end{cases}\n&F_0(X,E)&\\coloneqq(X,\\rho_E),\\\\\nR_f(x,y)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}E(x)&f(x)=y,\\\\\\varnothing&f(x)\\ne y,\\end{cases}\n&F_1\\langle(X,E),(Y,G),f\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\langle F_0(X,E),F_0(Y,G),[R_f]\\rangle,\\\\\n\\widetilde E_A(c)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in c}\\rho(i,i)\\quad(c\\in\\Gamma A),\n&s_0(A)&\\coloneqq(\\Gamma A,\\widetilde E_A),\\\\\ns_1\\langle A,B,[R]\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\langle s_0(A),s_0(B),\\Gamma[R]\\rangle,\\\\\nF&\\coloneqq\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle,&s&\\coloneqq\\langle s_0,s_1\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Functor}(F,\\omega\\mathbf{Sets},\\mathbf{Eff}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Functor}(s,\\mathbf{Eff},\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}),\\qquad s\\dashv F,\\\\\nF_{(X,E),(Y,G)}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle a,F_1(a)\\rangle\\mid a\\in\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}((X,E),(Y,G))\\},\\\\\nF_{(X,E),(Y,G)}:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}((X,E),(Y,G))\n\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(F_0(X,E),F_0(Y,G)).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"h:s(I,\\rho)\\to(X,E)","display":false},{"tex":"H(i,x)=\\rho(i,i)","display":false},{"tex":"h([i])=x","display":false},{"tex":"sF(X,E)\\cong(X,E)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"s\\dashv F","display":false}],"bytes":3097,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-435","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff|thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff — omega 集合的反射嵌入]]"},{"id":"40fee94342fc09ce","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf N$ 使用 [[16-prop-nno-eff]] 的自然数PER对象；$F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}$ 使用 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]。设 $D=\\{0,1\\}$、$E_D(d)=\\{d\\}$，$\\mathbf2=F(D,E_D)$。$b_0:1\\rightarrowtail\\mathbf2$ 是元素0诱导的单态（其图关系在该嵌入中给出）。"},{"id":"7046791115d871d9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}$ 与 $s:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}$ 采用 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]] 的公式。"},{"id":"c84f27165609eabd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf N=F(\\mathbb N,n\\mapsto\\{n\\})$、$F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}$ 使用 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]，等同于 [[16-prop-nno-eff]] 的二元PER对象。$\\varphi_e$ 为 [[16-df-kleene-numbering]] 已固定的同一可接受编号。"},{"id":"512abfcc793a6632","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$j_{\\neg\\neg}=\\neg_\\Omega\\neg_\\Omega$ 是 [[16-df-nucleus]] 构造的双重否定nucleus；$\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}$ 与 $\\mathbf{Set}$ 的嵌入取 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]、[[16-thm-sets-embedding-eff]]。"}],"outgoing":["1c2ab0a38c74fb9f","8ffba7376827cc25","fc49efccd7348d66","a88937ea87ff8530"]}